        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> Psalm </STYLE> of <gr str="1732">David</gr>. <gr str="8199">Judge </gr>me, O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>; <gr str="3588">for </gr>
        <gr str="589">I </gr>have <gr str="1980">walked </gr>in mine <gr str="8537">integrity</gr>: I have <gr str="982">trusted </gr>also in the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>; <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> therefore </STYLE> I shall <gr str="3808">not </gr>
