        <gr str="2154">mischief</gr>, and their right <gr str="3225">hand </gr>is <gr str="4390">full </gr>of <gr str="7810">bribes</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="11"> But as for <gr str="589">me</gr>, I will <gr str="1980">walk </gr>in mine <gr str="8537">integrity</gr>: <gr str="6299">redeem </gr>me, and be <gr str="2603">merciful </gr>unto me. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12"> My <gr str="7272">foot </gr>
